description:
Recorded Decibel data, free, no registration. series:
        "vault" = the Decibel Protocol Vault (DLP, the exchange's market maker) right now: TVL,
        PnL, fee income and its position on every market;
        "funding" / "open_interest" / "mark" = one market (e.g. market="BTC"), a point every
        5 minutes for the last `hours` (max 24); funding in bps per hour, positive = longs pay;
        "dlp_position" = the vault's size and entry on one market, every 15 minutes;
        "vault_tvl" = the vault's TVL and all-time PnL, every 15 minutes;
        "exchange_daily" = Decibel's daily volume, fees and open interest, last 30 days.
        Every answer says when the data is from. Data, not advice.
